","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia commit, DL Marcellus Young Casario died after 'sudden medical emergency'","description":"Marcellus Young Casario, a Georgia football commit, died Friday after experiencing a \"sudden medical emergency,\" according to his high school.","published":"2026-11-14T20:36:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50482223/georgia-football-commit-marcellus-young-casario-dies-suddenly","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oklahoma AD rips Ole Miss, SEC; Rebels defend travel effort","description":"Oklahoma AD Roger Denny ripped the SEC and Ole Miss for the \"inexplicable\" decision to move its game to Sunday, while the Rebels defended their travel efforts.","published":"2026-11-14T23:54:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50482206/oklahoma-ad-infuriated-sec-ole-miss-sunday-game","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Clemson QB Reynolds to have MRI on knee; backup Vizzina (ankle) also hurt","description":"Clemson quarterback Tait Reynolds is having an MRI on his injured knee, and backup Christopher Vizzina was sent to the hospital to evaluate his ankle.","published":"2026-11-14T23:52:45.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50482105/clemson-qb-tait-reynolds-suffers-leg-injury-slide","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Central Oklahoma AD trolls Ole Miss amid FAA crisis-forced kickoff change","description":"The Division II school offered Ole Miss fans attending its Oklahoma matchup free admission due to the kickoff date change.","published":"2026-11-14T22:28:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481529/central-oklahoma-troll-ole-miss-faa-decsion","type":"Story","byline":"Kalan Hooks","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Ohio State WR Smith sets Big Ten record, states Heisman case","description":"Ohio State wide receiver Jeremiah Smith broke yet another record, eclipsing the Big Ten mark for career receiving yards while also making his Heisman Trophy case in Saturday's win over Northwestern.","published":"2026-11-14T23:15:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481134/ohio-state-jeremiah-smith-sets-big-ten-receiving-record","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079636/dom-nichols","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dominic_Nichols"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Dominic Nichols","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dominic_Nichols","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:11Z","intro":"Dominic Nichols (born February 6, 2006) is an American football defensive end for the Michigan Wolverines.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Nichols attended Oakdale High School in Frederick, Maryland. He was rated as a four-star recruit by 247Sports and committed to play college football for the Michigan Wolverines over offers from Clemson, Kentucky, and Wisconsin."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"In the 2024 ReliaQuest Bowl, Nichols totaled two tackles and a forced fumble in an upset win over Alabama. As a freshman during the 2024 season, he played in five games, recording three tackles and a forced fumble. In 2025, Nichols notched 19 tackles with five and a half for a loss and a sack."}]}}